    "description": "The image has no USER instruction, so the entrypoint runs as root with the full default capability set. The base is python:2.7.14-jessie, referenced by mutable tag with no digest pin, and Debian Jessie is archived and unpatched. pip and setuptools are upgraded unpinned at build time, there is no HEALTHCHECK, no read-only filesystem directive and no non-root port consideration.",
