    "description": "Handlers index request.json[\"username\"], [\"password\"] and [\"url\"] directly. A missing key raises KeyError and a non-JSON or absent body raises TypeError/UnsupportedMediaType, so untrusted input controls whether the process throws. Nothing constrains type, length, character set or request size, and MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH is unset.",
