    "description": "No HSTS, Content-Security-Policy, X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy or Cache-Control headers are set, and nothing forces HTTPS. The CSV export is returned by send_file without an explicit mimetype or Content-Disposition, and /webhooks/test returns arbitrary upstream text with the response's own content type.",
